# Chris's Portfolio

A personal portfolio website created to showcase Chris’s work in music, engineering, and creative projects.

## Live Website

[View the portfolio](https://lilshopao.github.io/Chris-s-Portfolio/)

## About the Project

I created this portfolio website for a friend who works in music and engineering but did not yet have a portfolio to showcase his experience and projects.

The goal was to build a professional, accessible website where he could present his background, creative work, technical interests, and future projects in one place.

I began with my own website template and customized the structure, content, layout, and design to better represent Chris and his work.

## Features

- Personal introduction and background
- Music and engineering-focused content
- Project and experience sections
- Responsive layout for desktop and mobile devices
- Organized navigation between sections
- Links to relevant work and information
- Clean, personalized visual design

## Technologies Used

- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript
- GitHub Pages

## My Contributions

- Created the initial portfolio website structure
- Adapted the design for Chris’s background and interests
- Organized his music, engineering, and personal information
- Customized the layout and styling
- Improved the content and user experience
- Added responsive design considerations
- Published the website using GitHub Pages
- Tested and refined the website during development

## What I Learned

Through this project, I practiced:

- Designing a website around another person’s goals and identity
- Structuring a multi-section portfolio website
- Using HTML and CSS to create a clean layout
- Using JavaScript to add interactivity
- Improving website usability and presentation
- Publishing a website through GitHub Pages
- Communicating with a user to understand what their website should accomplish
- Refining an existing design through feedback and experimentation

## Future Improvements

- Add more examples of Chris’s music and engineering work
- Add project screenshots, audio samples, or videos
- Improve accessibility throughout the website
- Add more interactive features
- Improve the mobile layout
- Add a contact form
- Connect the portfolio to a custom domain

